  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Making SMEs Export Ready</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Truvalu (Agribusiness Booster B.V.) was founded in 2015 and has several subsidiaries that form an ecosystem to support small and growing businesses in the agro-food and home decoration sector. Truvalu enterprises provides various export readiness services (including strategy, commercial, financial and market access support) through its network of external consultants, as well as a pool of international and local consultants. With regard to this specific project, Truvalu is supporting 8 selected SMEs in 6 different countries (Kenya; Bangladesh; Colombia; India; Bolivia; Nepal) and make them export and investment-ready. By doing so they support (rural) job creation, poverty alleviation and food security in those countries.</narrative>
  </description>
